</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/187286/32/32936/258641/63ef3fe4Feda2b9cc/24ea418a76f220a0.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">运输服务</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">提供多种运输产品的组合服务，包括：同城串点配送服务零担/整车送仓服务 (500KG以上)、基于京东物流标准快运网络的快运服务 (500KG以下) 、基于京东物流快递网络以及三通一达的三方快递网络的快递服务；以及送货上楼、装卸货等运输增值服务。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/16742/19/23167/317018/63ef3ff0Fccb9e61e/19591a71077d735e.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">科技加持</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">提供基于区块链技术的奶粉溯源，可实现商品原产地溯源、物流节点信息可见、与消费者宣传性互动功能，金融增值提供动产融资、采购融资服务。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/62386/29/24569/128814/63ef3ff6Fdd70eb68/bc1c1186b19ff241.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\